{"id":"43ca2d9b7fc5df00","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-acf-decidable.md","title":"ACF Decidability","display":"thm-acf-decidable — ACF Decidability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-acf-decidable","aliases":["57-thm-acf-decidable"],"display":"thm-acf-decidable — ACF Decidability","depends_on":["[[57-df-decidable-theory]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-df-omega]]","[[57-df-field]]","[[57-df-acf]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]","[[57-df-recursive-function]]","[[57-df-quantifier-free]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-acf-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-acf-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-acf-decidable — ACF Decidability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4107e891ce817208\" href=\"?note=4107e891ce817208\" title=\"57-df-decidable-theory\">57-df-decidable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"be21afa871789456\" href=\"?note=be21afa871789456\" title=\"57-df-field\">57-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2f1b489ae787f3c0\" href=\"?note=2f1b489ae787f3c0\" title=\"57-df-acf\">57-df-acf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=0\">\\(p=0\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为素数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}\">\\(\\mathrm{Char}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"be21afa871789456\" href=\"?note=be21afa871789456\" title=\"57-df-field\">57-df-field</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ACF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2f1b489ae787f3c0\" href=\"?note=2f1b489ae787f3c0\" title=\"57-df-acf\">57-df-acf</a>。保留原逆元函数在零处未指定值的约定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为该有限语言的有效编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为标准 Hilbert 推导，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4107e891ce817208\" href=\"?note=4107e891ce817208\" title=\"57-df-decidable-theory\">57-df-decidable-theory</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffQE}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffQE}\\)</span> 在下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(q)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(q)\\)</span> 是函数递归性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 是总函数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{inv}\\in\\mathrm{Func}_1(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})\">\\(\\mathrm{inv}\\in\\mathrm{Func}_1(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"be21afa871789456\" href=\"?note=be21afa871789456\" title=\"57-df-field\">57-df-field</a> 的一元逆元函数符号；其在零处的解释沿用上述约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_p\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}:\\mathrm{Field}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{ACF}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)=p\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_p\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}:\\mathrm{Field}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{ACF}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)=p\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACF}_p\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}:\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in K_p\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ACF}_p\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}:\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in K_p\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffQE}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Rec}(q)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QF}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\;\n(q(g(\\varphi))=g(\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\land T\\models(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi))\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EffQE}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Rec}(q)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QF}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\;\n(q(g(\\varphi))=g(\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\land T\\models(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi))\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffQE}(\\mathrm{ACF}_p)\\land\\mathrm{ACF}_p\\in\\mathrm{Dec}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EffQE}(\\mathrm{ACF}_p)\\land\\mathrm{ACF}_p\\in\\mathrm{Dec}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACF}_p^{0}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{ACF}_p\\cup\\{\\mathrm{inv}(0)\\doteq0\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ACF}_p^{0}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{ACF}_p\\cup\\{\\mathrm{inv}(0)\\doteq0\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACF}_p^0\\in\\mathrm{Dec}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\;(\\mathrm{ACF}_p^0\\vdash\\varphi\\lor\\mathrm{ACF}_p^0\\vdash\\neg\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ACF}_p^0\\in\\mathrm{Dec}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\;(\\mathrm{ACF}_p^0\\vdash\\varphi\\lor\\mathrm{ACF}_p^0\\vdash\\neg\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACF}_p\\nvdash\\mathrm{inv}(0)\\doteq0\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\mathrm{ACF}_p\\nvdash\\neg(\\mathrm{inv}(0)\\doteq0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ACF}_p\\nvdash\\mathrm{inv}(0)\\doteq0\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\mathrm{ACF}_p\\nvdash\\neg(\\mathrm{inv}(0)\\doteq0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原语言含一个在零处未定值的总逆元函数，因此原 ACF_p 的完全性断言不成立。这里保留该理论的实际对象和可判定性，另外陈述固定 inv(0)=0 的子情形的完全性，而不把这条公理偷偷加入原 Field/ACF 定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"4107e891ce817208","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-decidable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"be21afa871789456","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-acf","